# Buildwise configuration index.
#
# Each app has its own example file. Copy them for local development:
#   backend/.env.example   → backend/.env          (server-side; may later hold local-only secrets)
#   frontend/.env.example  → frontend/.env.local   (PUBLIC: compiled into the browser bundle)
#
# All .env files are git-ignored. Never commit real values.
#
# The full list of variables and secrets for the deployed (gcp) profile is in
# docs/12_DEPLOYMENT_RUNBOOK.md §3.
#
# Variables for later milestones. Not used in M1.
# Local development only: when deployed, secrets live in Google Secret Manager
# and are mounted into Cloud Run, never set as plain env vars or sent to the frontend.
#
# M2 — Shopify (backend only)
# SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN=
# SHOPIFY_CLIENT_ID=
# SHOPIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=          # secret
#
# Meta WhatsApp (backend only)
# META_APP_ID=
# META_APP_SECRET=                # secret
# WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
# WHATSAPP_WABA_ID=
#
# Gemini / Vertex AI (backend only)
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION=
# GEMINI_MODEL=
